Package: principalMoments
Title: Principal Representations of Truncated Moment Sequences
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Angus", "McLure", email = "angus.mclure@anu.edu.au",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes lower and upper principal representations of probability
    distributions on a compact interval from truncated raw moment sequences.
    Provides feasibility checks, boundary recovery, Gaussian quadrature via
    symmetric eigenproblems, and evaluation of integrals and distribution
    functionals. For integrands satisfying the Markov-Krein derivative-sign
    condition, the representations give sharp moment-constrained bounds.
